# Build outputs produced while generating or re-checking goldens.
**/target/

# Scratch lockfiles. The committed goldens are:
#   lockfile-golden/Cargo.lock            (byte-compare golden, committed)
#   */golden.Cargo.lock                   (lock snapshots, committed)
# Live Cargo.lock files next to the goldens are regenerated by oracle.sh
# and must not be committed.
**/Cargo.lock
!lockfile-golden/Cargo.lock
